mapping "V6879.1" source="V6879" target="242116005" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target effect=omitted quality=60 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V6879 (Swedish 5-char extension of ICD-10 V68.7) = occupant of heavy transport vehicle,
        person on outside of vehicle, injured in noncollision traffic accident, activity unspecified.
        Parent V68.7 (Athena 45575790) maps to SNOMED CT 432509 (Accident to motor vehicle on road, not
        involving collision) and 444074 (Victim of vehicular AND/OR traffic accident). The Swedish
        activity qualifier (unspecified) is below SNOMED CT's granularity for transport-injury events;
        target fully contains the clinical event. broader: target subsumes source (no activity
        differentiation). Moderate on primary: inherited crosswalk, not independently re-verified; on
        444074: general victim concept loses vehicle/collision specificity.
        """
}
